 &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_1d" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);">,To Whom It May Concern<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_1j" data-hveid="CAAIDRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_1k" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);">We</span><span class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_1k" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"> Hayat Scientific Medical and Chemical Corp.</span>&nbsp;represented by its owner and general manager<b> Dr. Mohammad Ugab Al-Jawabreh,</b>&nbsp;hereby formally declares and pledges its absolute commitment to the following fundamental labor principles and workplace standards across all its operations:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><ul class="KsbFXc U6u95" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="mPWODf#NS0kde" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_1r" data-ved="2ahUKEwicsNOm5_WWAxVQWEEAHahAFaUQ-7AUegYIAAgOEAA" data-hveid="CAAIDhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_1s" data-hveid="CAAIDhAB" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">:Compliance with National Labor Laws</span></div><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_1t" data-complete="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><div style="text-align: left;">The Company strictly complies with all applicable national labor laws, statutes, and regulatory frameworks. We guarantee the full protection of all legal rights, benefits, and entitlements for our entire workforce in complete alignment with statutory mandates.</div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_21" data-hveid="CAAIDhAE" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">:Discrimination and Harassment-Free Workplace</span></div><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_22" data-complete="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><div style="text-align: left;">We maintain a strict zero-tolerance policy against any form of discrimination, harassment, bullying, or intimidation. The Company is dedicated to providing a safe, healthy, and dignified working environment where every employee is treated with respect and protected by secure, confidential grievance mechanisms.</div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_2a" data-hveid="CAAIDhAH" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: 700;">:Equal Employment Opportunities (EEO)</span></div><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="fArQ5e_2b" data-complete="true" aria-owns="action-menu-parent-container" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" style="border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"><div style="text-align: left;">The Company guarantees equal opportunities for both women and men. Fairness and equity are strictly enforced across all professional stages—including recruitment, hiring, compensation, training, promotion, and career development—based solely on merit, qualifications, and competence.</div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><div data-os-fs="" tabindex="0" aria-hidden="true" style="margin: -1px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: -1px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"></div><div data-os-fs="" tabindex="0" aria-hidden="true" style="margin: -1px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: -1px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp